### VitePress
node_modules
scheduled-sale-manager/docs-src/.vitepress/dist
scheduled-sale-manager/docs-src/.vitepress/cache

# Generated build output — never committed, wiped and recreated on every build.
# The VitePress site is built for base /scheduled-sale-manager/, so the whole
# dist is copied into scheduled-sale-manager/ (landing at
# /scheduled-sale-manager/, docs under /scheduled-sale-manager/docs/).
# Everything there but the source folder is output, including whatever
# docs-src/public/ holds.
scheduled-sale-manager/*
!scheduled-sale-manager/docs-src/
